# Real-document corpora: large, redistributable under their own licences
# (SROIE ICDAR2019; Express Expense CC-BY-4.0), and not ours to commit.
# the 1.1 GB training corpus at the repo root (datasets, not source). ANCHORED with a leading
# slash on purpose: unanchored, this also swallowed app/data/, so the shipped medicine lexicon
# could never be committed -- it would have shipped as a 404 on the live site.
/data/
artifacts/*.npz

